   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h1> Custom Solutions for Presetting &amp; Measuring </h1>",
   "body": "",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/6/csm_reamCheck_cd82613a3d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»reamCheck««",
     "href": "/ca/products/presetting-measuring/vertical-devices/venturion/models/reamcheck",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»reamCheck««</h3> <p>With »»reamCheck«,« you can adjust complete machining tools—such as long reamers and fine boring tools—fully automatically, quickly, with repeatability, and user-independent.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/5/csm_torquematic_a1d5f5dc22.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»torquematic««",
     "href": "/ca/products/presetting-measuring/vertical-devices/venturion/models/torquematic",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»torquematic««</h3> <p>With »Torquematic«, tools with collet chucks can be adjusted to the correct length, clamped to a predefined torque, and measured fully automatically.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/0/csm_tribos_777b335f4d.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»tribos««",
     "href": "/ca/products/presetting-measuring/vertical-devices/venturion/models/tribos",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»tribos««</h3> <p>With »tribos,« you can install and perform μm-accurate measurements of the length of SCHUNK TRIBOS-type polygonal shrink chucks.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/0/csm_redomatic_e7534663d3.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»redomatic««",
     "href": "/ca/products/tool-heat-shrink-technology/redomatic",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»redomatic««</h3> <p>»»redomatic«« is the high-end solution for automated measuring, adjustment, and shrinking.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/6/4/csm_smartCheck_704ca1e175.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»smartCheck««",
     "href": "/ca/products/inspection-measuring/universal-measuring-machine/smartcheck",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»smartCheck««</h3> <p>The »»smartCheck«« adjustment, measurement, and inspection unit can visualize the surface condition of the cutting edge on the end face and circumference.</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/1/csm_phoenix_4eb6d525d4.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 633,
     "h": 356,
     "title": "»»phoenix««",
     "href": "/ca/products/presetting-measuring/custom-solutions/custom-solutions/phoenix",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»phoenix««</h3> <p>Highest precision in the measurement of fine-bore tools</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/3/csm_zenit_bbe8f40aa8.webp",
