     "href": "/ca/products/presetting-measuring/custom-solutions/custom-solutions/equick",
     "caption": "<figcaption> <h3>»»eQuick 200M««</h3> <p>Ergonomic Adjustment and Measurement of Crankshaft Cutters Using Transmitted Light</p> <br/> Learn more </figcaption>"
    },
    {
